OL,3,AJaguar Land Rover confirms planned job
OL,4,Acuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm told the BBC it had not
OL,7,Fconfirmed the numbers. It said the
OL,8,Fdecision to cut jobs was to help
OL,9,F"simplify" the organisation as well as
OL,10,F"improve efficiency and build greater
OL,11,Fresilience".
